    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32456" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ōlĕnos</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-us</span></b> , i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὤλενος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the husband of Lethœa</i>, <i>who was changed with her into a stone</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 10,
				69</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
